# Response headers for every runner response (Cloudflare Pages `_headers` format; plan 104 D7).
# {{SITE_ORIGINS}} is filled in by scripts/build.ts from deploy/origins.json (every site origin the
# build accepts: the primary, and for a production build the preview host too; plan 105 Phase D).
# - COOP/COEP make the runner cross-origin isolated (SharedArrayBuffer interrupts).
# - CORP cross-origin lets the site embed the runner under its own COEP: require-corp; it is on
#   every response (the document, the worker script and the Pyodide files).
# - The strict CSP: scripts only from this origin plus WebAssembly compilation, Pyodide's own
#   files fetched from this origin, and only the site may frame the runner.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors {{SITE_ORIGINS}}
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), hid=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), serial=(), usb=()
